* hand-written deck, not exported from any drawing
.title Charge pump with up/down switches
.global VDD
.subckt CP up dn out
.iodir up=input dn=input out=output
.name up UP
.name dn DN
.name out V_out
I1 VDD a
.name I1 I_1
MS1 out up a VDD pmos
.name MS1 S_1
MS2 out dn b 0 nmos
.name MS2 S_2
I2 b 0
.name I2 I_2
CP out 0
.name CP C_P
.ends
